{% set intro %}
    <p>These glyphs from <a href="https://www.halowaypoint.com/" title="HaloWaypoint.com - the official site for the Halo universe" class="text-convrtr">Halo</a> featured in an episode of <a href="https://www.halopedia.org/File:H5G_The_Sprint_Covenant_Font.png" title="Halopedia - Covenant Font image" class="text-convrtr">The Sprint</a>, the Halo 5: Guardians behind the scenes show.</p>
    <p>Type a message to see it in glyphs, or tap the glyphs you see to type their letters. "Save as image" downloads the glyphs as a picture.</p>
    <p>More on the <a href="https://www.halopedia.org/Sangheili_(language)" class="text-convrtr">Sangheili language</a> Halopedia page.</p>
